{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "先记录每个字母最后出现的位置，再从左向右扫描，用当前片段内所有字母的最远位置不断扩张右边界。当扫描下标追上右边界时，说明片段中的字母都不会在后面再次出现，此处应立即切分以得到尽可能多的片段。示例依次得到长度 9、7、8。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>划分字母区间可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;word-break:break-all}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.lasts,.result{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.chip{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:10px;text-align:center}\n.chip b{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.cells{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;text-align:center;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}\n.cell .char{font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.cell .index{margin-top:2px;font:9px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#8d8d8d}\n.tags{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;margin-top:2px;min-height:16px}\n.tag{padding:1px 2px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;color:#d4d4d4;font-size:10px;line-height:1.2}\n.cell.range{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.boundary{border-color:#3794ff}\n.status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.metric{flex:1 1 80px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c}\n.metric span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.metric strong{font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.message{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;line-height:1.45;font-size:11px}\n.segment{padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:10px;margin-top:4px}\n.segment.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.segment .len{margin-left:6px;color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.segment.active .len{color:#d4d4d4}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>贪心：最早合法切分</h1>\n<p class=\"lead mono\">ababcbacadefegdehijhklij</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"title\">① 字母最后下标</div>\n<div id=\"lasts\" class=\"lasts\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"title\">② 扫描扩张片段</div>\n<div id=\"cells\" class=\"cells\"></div>\n<div class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"metric\"><span>i</span><strong id=\"iValue\">0</strong></div>\n<div class=\"metric\"><span>start</span><strong id=\"startValue\">0</strong></div>\n<div class=\"metric\"><span>end</span><strong id=\"endValue\">8</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"message\" class=\"message\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"title\">③ 已确定片段</div>\n<div id=\"result\" class=\"result\"></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst s='ababcbacadefegdehijhklij';\nconst last={};[...s].forEach((c,i)=>last[c]=i);\nconst letters=Object.keys(last).sort();\ndocument.getElementById('lasts').innerHTML=letters.map(c=>`<div class=\"chip\"><span>${c}→</span><b>${last[c]}</b></div>`).join('');\nconst cuts=[{a:0,b:8},{a:9,b:15},{a:16,b:23}];\nlet step=0;\nfunction stateAt(i){let start=0,end=0,done=[];for(let k=0;k<=i;k++){end=Math.max(end,last[s[k]]);if(k===end){done.push({a:start,b:end});start=k+1}}return{start,end,done}}\nfunction render(){\n const finished=step>=s.length;\n const i=finished?s.length-1:step;\n const st=stateAt(i);\n const activeStart=finished?s.length:(i===st.end?st.done[st.done.length-1].a:st.start);\n document.getElementById('cells').innerHTML=[...s].map((c,k)=>{\n  const inRange=!finished&&k>=activeStart&&k<=st.end;\n  const cls=['cell',inRange?'range':'',!finished&&k===i?'current':'',!finished&&k===st.end?'boundary':''].join(' ');\n  const tags=[];if(!finished&&k===i)tags.push('<span class=\"tag\">i</span>');if(!finished&&k===activeStart)tags.push('<span class=\"tag\">start</span>');if(!finished&&k===st.end)tags.push('<span class=\"tag\">end</span>');\n  return `<div class=\"${cls}\"><div class=\"char\">${c}</div><div class=\"index\">${k}</div><div class=\"tags\">${tags.join('')}</div></div>`\n }).join('');\n document.getElementById('iValue').textContent=finished?'完成':i;\n document.getElementById('startValue').textContent=finished?'—':activeStart;\n document.getElementById('endValue').textContent=finished?'—':st.end;\n let message;\n if(finished) message='扫描结束。三个片段覆盖原字符串，且任一字母都没有跨越片段。';\n else if(i===st.end) message=`下标 ${i} 已追上右边界：立即切分，得到长度 ${i-activeStart+1}。`;\n else message=`字符 ${s[i]} 最后出现在 ${last[s[i]]}，右边界更新为 max(${i===0?0:stateAt(i-1).end}, ${last[s[i]]}) = ${st.end}。`;\n document.getElementById('message').textContent=message;\n const shown=finished?cuts:st.done;\n document.getElementById('result').innerHTML=cuts.map((x,n)=>{const ready=n<shown.length;return `<div class=\"segment ${ready?'active':''}\"><span class=\"mono\">${s.slice(x.a,x.b+1)}</span><span class=\"len\">${ready?x.b-x.a+1:'?'}</span></div>`}).join('');\n step=(step+1)%(s.length+1);\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1800);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O(n)","space_complexity":"O(1)","complexity_note":"n 为字符串长度. 记录最后位置与切分各扫描一次; 题目限定 26 个小写字母, 位置表大小固定, 返回片段数量也不超过 26."}
